      "side": 1,
      "message": "The java_import module type does not work properly unless it is given an actual file name. The general prebuilts support requires each prebuilt module to have a non-nil src or non-empty srcs property, otherwise the prebuilt is ignored in favour of the source, even if it is preferred. Your build might be working because it is using the source module.",
