      "side": 1,
      "message": "They\u0027re already generated without neither \"src\" nor \"srcs\" properties.\n\nIf you mean the \"jars\" property, then when does it not work? Because I couldn\u0027t entice any error when using the prebuilt core-icu4j on master-art, which doesn\u0027t have the source module in external/icu/android_icu4j/Android.bp.\n\nSo it may be worth checking if it\u0027s really necessary anymore, but not blocking this CL.",
